  ('Digital Privacy', 'Who is it safe to share your LittleNet password with?', 'Your best classmate', 'A gamer online offering free coins', 'Only your parent or guardian', 'Anyone who asks politely in chat', 'Only your parent or guardian', 'Only parents or guardians should ever know your login password.'),
