  ('Digital Privacy', 'If an online quiz asks for your real school name and grade, what should you do?', 'Type your school and bus stop', 'Ask a parent or skip the quiz', 'Type your friend''s school', 'Share your classroom number', 'Ask a parent or skip the quiz', 'Never enter your school location into unfamiliar websites or apps.'),
