  ('Digital Privacy', 'What is two-factor authentication (2FA)?', 'Using two different passwords', 'An extra security step to prove it is really you logging in', 'Having two accounts on LittleNet', 'Logging in on two phones at once', 'An extra security step to prove it is really you logging in', '2FA adds an important second lock to protect your account.'),
