  ('Digital Privacy', 'What should you do if you accidentally share your password with someone?', 'Nothing if they promised to keep it secret', 'Change your password immediately and tell a parent', 'Delete all your posts', 'Create five new accounts', 'Change your password immediately and tell a parent', 'Changing your password right away stops anyone else from accessing your profile.'),
  ('Digital Privacy', 'Is it okay to use public Wi-Fi without asking a parent?', 'Yes, always connect to any free network', 'It is safer to ask a parent first because open networks can be insecure', 'Public Wi-Fi is always 100% encrypted', 'Only if you stream movies', 'It is safer to ask a parent first because open networks can be insecure', 'Unsecured public Wi-Fi can allow others on the same network to intercept traffic.'),
