  ('Digital Privacy', 'What should you do if an app asks for permission to use your camera and contacts?', 'Accept all permissions without looking', 'Ask your parent if the app really needs those permissions', 'Deny phone power', 'Turn off Wi-Fi forever', 'Ask your parent if the app really needs those permissions', 'Apps should only have permissions they genuinely need to function.'),
  ('Digital Privacy', 'If you see a "Remember My Password" box on a shared computer at school or library, you should:', 'Check the box', 'Leave it unchecked and log out when done', 'Save your credit card', 'Leave the browser open', 'Leave it unchecked and log out when done', 'Never save passwords on shared or public school devices.'),

