  ('Online Kindness', 'How should you apologize if you accidentally posted something that hurt a classmate?', 'Ignore them and pretend it never happened', 'Reach out sincerely, apologize, and delete the hurtful post', 'Blame your autocorrect', 'Post an angry story', 'Reach out sincerely, apologize, and delete the hurtful post', 'A genuine apology and taking down hurtful content shows maturity.'),
  ('Online Kindness', 'Why are all-caps words (LIKE THIS) often avoided in polite chats?', 'They use too much phone memory', 'They can look like shouting or anger', 'They are harder for robots to read', 'They disable emojis', 'They can look like shouting or anger', 'TYPING IN ALL CAPS often feels like yelling to the reader.'),
  ('Online Kindness', 'What is the Golden Rule of the internet?', 'Always get the most likes', 'Treat others online the way you want to be treated', 'Post 10 times a day', 'Never like anyone''s post', 'Treat others online the way you want to be treated', 'Treating others with respect creates a positive digital world for everyone.'),
